        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin RUS-RAR, Rustic Bronze Knob with Arched Roses</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAs part of Baldwins' Reserve Collection, The Rustic Bronze Knob with Arched Rose is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. It is designed to be easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/8 inches up to 2-1/2 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This half-round knob is available in either dark bronze or white bronze finishes. Choose from a keyed entry, passage, privacy, or dummy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Rustic Half-Round Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1/8\" cross bore and 1\" edge bore for latch</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry features the Baldwin 5-pin tumbler C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Tested to exceed ANSI/BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Rustic Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-11/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Arched Rose Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Arched Rose Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> Non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. Interior roses and Half Dummy roses have exposed screws.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-Rustic-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354531\" width=\"384\" height=\"176\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Reserve Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Rustic Bronze Knob with Arched Rose, Baldwin RUS-RAR",
                "description": "Baldwin RUS-RAR, Rustic Half Round Knob with Arched Rose - As part of Baldwins' Reserve Collection, The Rustic Knob with Rustic Arch Rose is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. It is designed to be easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/8 inches up to 2-1/2 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This half-round knob is available in either dark bronze or white bronze finishes. Choose from a keyed entry, passage, privacy, or dummy functions.",
